    <article class="about-copy">
        <h1>Hello, I'm Sinolizwi.</h1>

        <p>
            I'm the founder of Re-Center Hub. I hold a Bachelor's
            degree in Child and Youth Care (Cum Laude) and a
            Master's degree in Child and Youth Care from the
            Durban University of Technology.
        </p>

        <p>
            Over the years, I have worked in schools and boarding
            houses, providing counselling, youth development and
            learner support. My experience includes psychosocial
            support, youth development and mentorship, wellness and
            intervention programmes, life skills education, and
            creating inclusive and supportive environments for
            young people.
        </p>

        <p>
            Through this work, I've seen the need for safe spaces
            where young people and families can receive guidance,
            support, healing and empowerment. That vision led to
            Re-Center Hub: a space focused on rebuilding minds,
            re-centering lives, and helping individuals rediscover
            purpose and growth.
        </p>

        <p>
            I'm passionate about meaningful change in communities
            through emotional wellbeing, youth empowerment,
            mentorship and personal development.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Thank you for being part of this journey.</strong></p>

        <p style="color:#d4af37;font-weight:600">
            A Hub for Growth. A Path to Purpose.
        </p>
    </article>
</div>